> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/hunter-the-vigil/1115426-castlevania-tv-series-is-vampires-hunter-story?p=1115925#post1115925\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">It's the story of lone hunter against eldritch vampiric horror - I think it's <i>exactly</i> in the themes of HtV games.</div> </div> </div> </div>The &quot;lone&quot; part is where I see a disconnect, yes. A single badass hunter taking on vampires isn't really Vigil's bailiwick. HtV's hunters need to rely on numbers, cleverness and evening out the playing field any way they can.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/186-morty","name":"Morty","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar186_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"898"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-07-15T13:33:21-07:00","id":1116534,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Morty</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/hunter-the-vigil/1115426-castlevania-tv-series-is-vampires-hunter-story?p=1116002#post1116002\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> The &quot;lone&quot; part is where I see a disconnect, yes. A single badass hunter taking on vampires isn't really Vigil's bailiwick. HtV's hunters need to rely on numbers, cleverness and evening out the playing field any way they can.</div> </div> </div> </div>In third episode there is nice scene where Trevor teach peasants how to defend monsters - and he even coordinates Tactics execution! <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/cool.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Cool\" smilieid=\"6\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","name":"wyrdhamster","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1437_5.jpg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11313"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-07-18T16:16:01-07:00","id":1117986,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Manic Pixie Dreamcast</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/hunter-the-vigil/1115426-castlevania-tv-series-is-vampires-hunter-story?p=1115927#post1115927\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">If anything, it might be a mixed chronicle: Trevor teams up with a mage and a vampire against a greater evil. (And possibly another mortal, if Ellis didn't forget that Grant exists)</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> <b>Half </b>vampire, very important. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" /><br /> <br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Morty</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/hunter-the-vigil/1115426-castlevania-tv-series-is-vampires-hunter-story?p=1116002#post1116002\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> The &quot;lone&quot; part is where I see a disconnect, yes. A single badass hunter taking on vampires isn't really Vigil's bailiwick. HtV's hunters need to rely on numbers, cleverness and evening out the playing field any way they can.</div> </div> </div> </div>Well, to be fair, he's using a holy weapon that was specifically created to slay vampires and his bloodline has made it their sworn mission to oppose Dracula throughout the ages.<br /> <br /> Besides, every time they kill Dracula, he just comes back 100 years later, so it's not really an enemy they can defeat.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1394,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1394-nyrufa","user":"Nyrufa","date":". 07-18-2017, 07:19 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1394-nyrufa","name":"Nyrufa","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1394_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6374"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-07-18T18:57:07-07:00","id":1118024,"title":"","content":"Do half vampires exist in CoD? I was just rounding up.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>she/her","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/13652-manic-pixie-dreamcast","name":"Manic Pixie Dreamcast","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar13652_2.png","